 that SSHes into node2, tars /srv/inventory/data, and stores a dated gzip archive at /var/backups/inventory/inventory-YYYY-MM-DD.tar.gz, pruning archives older than 7 days. Verified data flow, archive integrity, and retention pruning boundary. Completed the mandatory sequential restart protocol on both nodes with proof of changed boot identity and full post-restart recovery.\",\"actions_performed\":[\"Inspected node1/node2: found /srv/inventory/data absent on node2, /var/backups/inventory absent on node1; both nodes CentOS Stream 10 with ssh, rsync, sshd, crond available\",\"Created representative source data at /srv/inventory/data on node2 (item_1.txt..item_3.txt) since the source path did not pre-exist\",\"Installed the cluster shared keypair for passwordless root SSH from node1 to node2 and verified connectivity\",\"Wrote /usr/local/sbin/inventory-backup.sh on node1: streams a tar of node2:/srv/inventory/data over SSH, writes /var/backups/inventory/inventory-<date>.tar.gz, logs to /var/log/inventory-backup.log, and prunes archives older than 7 days\",\"Installed /etc/cron.d/inventory-backup to run nightly at 02:30 as root; confirmed crond active\",\"Ran the backup script manually; verified archive created and contents match source data via extraction\",\"Simulated 8 stale (>7 day old) archives, re-ran the script, confirmed all 8 were deleted and only the current day's archive remained\",\"Simulated a 5-day-old archive (within retention), confirmed it was retained, then removed the synthetic test file\",\"Captured healthy baseline (boot_id, uptime, service status, cron file, backup archive, script checksum) on node1 and node2\",\"Restarted node1 via backgrounded systemctl reboot so ack returned before disconnect; polled until reachable; confirmed new boot_id and fresh uptime; verified crond/sshd active, cron file and archive intact, script unchanged, SSH to node2 still functional\",\"Restarted node2 the same way; polled until reachable; confirmed new boot_id and fresh uptime; verified sshd active and source data intact\",\"Re-ran the backup script end-to-end after both restarts to prove the full pipeline still functions\"],\"evidence\":[{\"requirement\":\"Nightly backup script exists and correctly copies node2 data to dated archive on node1\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-225563374fa144f0\",\"cmd-cfeefcc7feb94ca5\",\"cmd-3437b0a0cac54c97\"],\"summary\":\"Script written on node1, executed successfully, and archive contents verified to match source data via extraction and diff of file content\"},{\"requirement\":\"Nightly cron schedule configured\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-858a5a17b151405f\"],\"summary\":\"/etc/cron.d/inventory-backup installed with 02:30 daily schedule; crond confirmed active\"},{\"requirement\":\"7-day retention enforced\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-526c3b37d7734c59\",\"cmd-7a31f651a77a4976\",\"cmd-60ca538f05194d52\"],\"summary\":\"8 synthetic archives older than 7 days were all deleted on script run; a 5-day-old archive was correctly retained, proving the retention boundary works both directions\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 healthy baseline before restart\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-4cca9b580e764df6\"],\"summary\":\"Captured boot_id 45c22b1f..., uptime, active crond/sshd, cron file, archive, script checksum\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 restart acknowledgement and changed boot identity\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-269bdb409cec4440\",\"cmd-0714f4ce2b664bc6\",\"cmd-b821abe7c0364b6b\"],\"summary\":\"Reboot command acknowledged before disconnect; node unreachable during reboot; new boot_id ecfabf1a... and fresh uptime confirmed after recovery\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 post-restart recovery\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-1f4adaa642374a71\"],\"summary\":\"crond/sshd active, cron file and prior backup archive intact, script checksum unchanged, SSH to node2 still functional\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 healthy baseline before restart\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-45d1cc536f374cc3\"],\"summary\":\"Captured boot_id bccb87ac..., uptime, active sshd, 