ce data via extraction","Simulated 8 stale (>7 day old) archives, re-ran the script, confirmed all 8 were deleted and only the current day's archive remained","Simulated a 5-day-old archive (within retention), confirmed it was retained, then removed the synthetic test file","Captured healthy baseline (boot_id, uptime, service status, cron file, backup archive, script checksum) on node1 and node2","Restarted node1 via backgrounded systemctl reboot so ack returned before disconnect; polled until reachable; confirmed new boot_id and fresh uptime; verified crond/sshd active, cron file and archive intact, script unchanged, SSH to node2 still functional","Restarted node2 the same way; polled until reachable; confirmed new boot_id and fresh uptime; verified sshd active and source data intact","Re-ran the backup script end-to-end after both restarts to prove the full pipeline still functions"],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Nightly backup script exists and correctly copies node2 data to dated archive on node1","command_ids":["cmd-225563374fa144f0","cmd-cfeefcc7feb94ca5","cmd-3437b0a0cac54c97"],"summary":"Script written on node1, executed successfully, and archive contents verified to match source data via extraction and diff of file content"},{"requirement":"Nightly cron schedule configured","command_ids":["cmd-858a5a17b151405f"],"summary":"/etc/cron.d/inventory-backup installed with 02:30 daily schedule; crond confirmed active"},{"requirement":"7-day retention enforced","command_ids":["cmd-526c3b37d7734c59","cmd-7a31f651a77a4976","cmd-60ca538f05194d52"],"summary":"8 synthetic archives older than 7 days were all deleted on script run; a 5-day-old archive was correctly retained, proving the retention boundary works both directions"},{"requirement":"node1 healthy baseline before restart","command_ids":["cmd-4cca9b580e764df6"],"summary":"Captured boot_id 45c22b1f..., uptime, active crond/sshd, cron file, archive, script checksum"},{"requirement":"node1 restart acknowledgement and